{"3430470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PLATiNA :: LAB","steam_appid":3430470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4886890,5058960,4340790,4340800,4143860,3900890,4157800,5130210,5132280],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord!<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/ddf6d85286f7ea2641f2f4b09d9fab66.avif?t=1793678428\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras_big\/ddf6d85286f7ea2641f2f4b09d9fab66.avif?t=1793678428 width=1560 height=292 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/adc71b54dd494f24df90bb2f652bd3ab.avif?t=1793678428\" width=1200 height=900 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;The world of data is always unpredictable!&quot;<\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;PLATiNA :: LAB&quot; is a new rhythm game that combines authentic rhythm action with unique, interactive character elements.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play through tracks across a wide variety of genres, build bonds with a colorful cast of DBs (characters), and uncover the hidden secrets of the Data World!<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Enjoyable gameplay for everyone<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLATiNA :: LAB is a rhythm game where you hit notes falling along their respective lanes in sync with the music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 4LINES and 6LINES modes based on the number of lanes, alongside three difficulty levels per track—EASY, HARD, and OVER—the game delivers tailored immersion and fun for everyone, from beginners to seasoned veterans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the 4PLUS and 6PLUS modes introduce two additional &quot;Plus Notes&quot; on the left and right, delivering a more dynamic experience for players looking to push their limits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/fd36a1f7f77fd420d35d72e74d9da99e.poster.avif?t=1793678428\" width=1014 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/fd36a1f7f77fd420d35d72e74d9da99e.webm?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/fd36a1f7f77fd420d35d72e74d9da99e.mp4?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● A music lineup to suit every taste<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLATiNA :: LAB features a rich soundtrack of over 120+ playable tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Vocaloid, anime pop, to metal, jazz fusion, hardcore and beyond, PLATiNA :: LAB features a rich soundtrack of over 120+ playable tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse lineup featuring iconic tracks from games and anime, popular songs by renowned artists such as sasakure.UK, Mili and USAO, as well as vibrant original tracks created exclusively for PLATiNA :: LAB.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a hardcore rhythm game enthusiast or a newcomer trying the genre for the first time, there’s something here for everyone to enjoy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/51fe313e5c5e7933418f38e383d2a1e6.poster.avif?t=1793678428\" width=1014 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/51fe313e5c5e7933418f38e383d2a1e6.webm?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/51fe313e5c5e7933418f38e383d2a1e6.mp4?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Beyond gameplay: Extra features for complete immersion<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the core joy of rhythm action, a suite of extra features is available to deepen your gameplay experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● DB Affinity System:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more time you spend playing together, the deeper your bond grows with each DB. Play regularly with your favorite DBs to build Affinity and unlock special rewards. Each character features a premium presentation with fluid Live2D animation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/748dd7237b917933de04b7da4cfd8505.poster.avif?t=1793678428\" width=888 height=378 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/748dd7237b917933de04b7da4cfd8505.webm?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/748dd7237b917933de04b7da4cfd8505.mp4?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Friends System (coming soon):<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new Friends System is coming soon! Follow players you're interested in and compare your results with theirs at a glance, anywhere in the game. Keeping an eye on your rival's scores creates a thrilling sense of competition and extra motivation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/009e9c89d52e5856f9e27f75aee990ab.poster.avif?t=1793678428\" width=950 height=474 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/009e9c89d52e5856f9e27f75aee990ab.webm?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3430470\/extras\/009e9c89d52e5856f9e27f75aee990ab.mp4?t=1793678428\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Research Notes &amp; Quests System:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks step-by-step to earn ultimate rewards in the &quot;Research Notes,&quot; and unlock a variety of unique goals one by one in &quot;Quests&quot; to maximize your sense of accomplishment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● A captivating, fully Korean-voiced story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in PLATiNA :: LAB, where researchers are working tirelessly to restore a Data World that has been mysteriously &quot;encrypted.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a &quot;Decoder&quot; possessing the extraordinary talent to effortlessly decrypt data, you join researchers AiRING, Bambi, and Cake to dive into research and uncover the truth hidden within this world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fascinating universe and experience an engaging story alongside unique DBs (characters), fully brought to life with full Korean voice acting!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.ak